2
msg:You play Jerry Todd; Peg, Red and Scoop help when present.
msg:Move with N S E W NE NW SE SW. LOOK or EXAMINE, TAKE, USE, OPEN, MOVE, SHOOT, THROW, DIG, HIDE, FOLLOW, CALL, CLIMB, UNTIE, RUN and WAIT are available.
msg:TALK FRIENDS offers a suggestion when the others are with you. SAVE, LOAD, RESTART and QUIT are available.

